{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20391",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.62,
      "end_seconds": 4.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Doctor, we're ready in room two, I've already taken the observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.28,
      "end_seconds": 10.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.67,
      "end_seconds": 18.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.4,
      "end_seconds": 24.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 25.39,
      "end_seconds": 32.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "It's being very thirsty, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.22,
      "end_seconds": 38.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Right, can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.78,
      "end_seconds": 41.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I'd say two weeks, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 43.31,
      "end_seconds": 46.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Hm, I'd say more like three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.25,
      "end_seconds": 52.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly two to three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.04,
      "end_seconds": 57.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "I suppose so, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.52,
      "end_seconds": 67.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.95,
      "end_seconds": 75.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "Only drinking water, and it's not much. It feels mild to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.61,
      "end_seconds": 79.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Alright, is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.35,
      "end_seconds": 85.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Recurrent thrush goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.96,
      "end_seconds": 92.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 92.73,
      "end_seconds": 98.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.93,
      "end_seconds": 102.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Right, later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.46,
      "end_seconds": 112.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "I've been losing some weight too, for about a month. The recurrent thrush? That's been for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.7,
      "end_seconds": 118.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Have you noticed fruity smelling breath or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.49,
      "end_seconds": 134.8,
      "duration_seconds": 14.31,
      "text": "No, no fruity smelling breath, no chest pain. I was passing a lot of urine at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.66,
      "end_seconds": 141.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any confusion, abdominal pain or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.77,
      "end_seconds": 146.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "No, no confusion, abdominal pain or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.61,
      "end_seconds": 153.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Nothing like fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.3,
      "end_seconds": 156.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.9,
      "end_seconds": 162.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.17,
      "end_seconds": 165.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.02,
      "end_seconds": 171.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.96,
      "end_seconds": 175.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.65,
      "end_seconds": 178.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.47,
      "end_seconds": 184.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Just an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.63,
      "end_seconds": 193.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.73,
      "end_seconds": 203.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.74,
      "end_seconds": 204.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.3,
      "end_seconds": 212.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for nearly five years. I've had an underactive thyroid, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.59,
      "end_seconds": 215.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.01,
      "end_seconds": 221.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Arthritis in my knees, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.32,
      "end_seconds": 231.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Alright, high blood pressure and high cholesterol, that matches what I have here. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.3,
      "end_seconds": 235.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.25,
      "end_seconds": 239.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Alright, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.28,
      "end_seconds": 242.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.61,
      "end_seconds": 245.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.13,
      "end_seconds": 249.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.16,
      "end_seconds": 253.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.3,
      "end_seconds": 257.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Rosuvastatin. I take it at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.24,
      "end_seconds": 261.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.82,
      "end_seconds": 264.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "It's 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.26,
      "end_seconds": 273.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a round yellow one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.22,
      "end_seconds": 278.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Okay, do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.45,
      "end_seconds": 290.64,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "For my thyroid, I believe. My daughter sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. It's naproxen, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.78,
      "end_seconds": 294.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.37,
      "end_seconds": 305.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.23,
      "text": "250 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. Before this I was on diclofenac; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.27,
      "end_seconds": 320.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Okay, are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.57,
      "end_seconds": 324.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 326.32,
      "end_seconds": 335.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Blood pressure 165 over 98, temp 36.6 degrees, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, heart rate 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.39,
      "end_seconds": 338.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.55,
      "end_seconds": 344.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.05,
      "end_seconds": 348.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.08,
      "end_seconds": 368.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Your fingerprick sugar here is high, and your feet have good pulses and normal feeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.15,
      "end_seconds": 400.17,
      "duration_seconds": 28.02,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Taking everything into account, this is probably symptoms that point to newly developed type 2 diabetes. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out an overactive thyroid yet. I can't rule out a urine infection yet. Just to be sure I understood. You've had being very thirsty, mild, and no vomiting or fruity smelling breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.47,
      "end_seconds": 403.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 417.17,
      "end_seconds": 451.31,
      "duration_seconds": 34.14,
      "text": "I think a fasting blood sugar makes sense here, for thirst and polyuria. I want an HbA1c done, that's for suspected diabetes. I'm prescribing metformin, 500 milligrams, once a day with food, long term. That's for high blood sugar. Cut right down on sugary drinks and keep water with you. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. I think the diabetes educator should see you too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 453.05,
      "end_seconds": 455.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 456.05,
      "end_seconds": 463.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "We'll catch up after the blood results. Okay, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 465.01,
      "end_seconds": 467.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 468.95,
      "end_seconds": 470.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}